<title>USA: Value Health holders ok Columbia merger.</title>
<headline>Value Health holders ok Columbia merger.</headline>
<dateline>AVON, Conn. 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Value Health Inc said Wednesday its shareholders approved the merger with Columbia/HCA Healthcare Corp for $20.50 in cash per Value Health share.</p>
<p>Value Health said the companies expect the merger to be completed at the end of June. The merger agreement was first announced in January and revised on April 15.</p>
<p>Value Health opened unchanged at 20-1/4 today, while Columbia opened at 39-1/8, down 1/4.</p>
